[1m[38;5;231mWhich rule representation?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mRule descriptors (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mFactories like required(), minLength(8), matches('password') returning {name, test, message}. Pure tests, central [39m
     [38;5;246mmessages, introspectable.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Bare predicates
     [38;5;246mfield -> [(value, all) => string | null]. Minimal machinery, messages written per call site, not introspectable.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Fluent builder
     [38;5;246mfield('password').required().min(8). Best ergonomics, most API surface to build and stabilize.[39m
